{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前有人把自己当作自己人，短暂高兴了一下，随后又意识到过去回不去了，并开始怀疑离开后是否真的会更好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、心酸、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"紫色短语里的具体心理和行动线索，如想往前却拿不定方向、出去走走透口气、刚才真的相信了吗、昂扬慢慢退潮；右上角小标题也不容易第一眼注意到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他回想起曾经被接纳的时刻，刚刚有过一点高兴，却马上被过去无法重来的失落和对离开后生活的疑问拉回来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、轻松、心酸、迷茫\",\n      \"missed\": \"紫色文字中的细分情绪、内心追问和行动线索需要逐条读才能理解；尤其那一刻的轻松是真的、心里的事没有答案这层意思不够醒目。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他怀念从前被当作自己人的日子，回忆带来短暂的温暖和轻松，但很快又被失去过去的刺痛以及对未来的迷茫压住。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、短暂轻松、心酸、焦躁、刺痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"故乡夏日的麦浪、越怀念越觉得远，以及焦躁急切、轻松亲近、刺痛得让人绝望等新增内容。虽然能看见这些词，但它们彼此的关系和对应的具体处境不容易一眼理清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段字号相近、同样醒目的长白字都承载了重要信息，第一眼不容易明确先抓哪一段；中间紫色短语又分散在多个位置，尤其第三张增加条数后，具体的回忆画面、情绪变化和人物处境之间缺少明显的视觉关联。主线其实能够读出来：想起曾经被接纳而短暂高兴，随后又因过去无法重来而心酸、迷茫。但要把那些感受和画面全部串起来，需要进一步阅读和自行整合。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dc071755-7772-410a-b827-fc93cb4c0016", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003910425829Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:40:02.526988+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b56ffca53e824d3e27a89b99a97404ceee64d1bb7022db12e160bd00c2fd1da4", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003910425829Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a3ef914d980944ce2f086955eb0d5eb752ce84925aa62420a589797aad6e0653"}}}
